.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\'>\r\n  <p class=col1><span class=\'sarabun-font\'>2. <span\r\n  lang=TH>&#3649;&#3610;&#3656;&#3591;&#3605;&#3634;&#3617;&#3627;&#3609;&#3656;&#3623;&#3618;</span></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=60 valign=top style=\'width:45.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\'>\r\n  <p class=col1><span class=\'sarabun-font\'>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=133 valign=top style=\'width:99.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\'>\r\n  <p class=\'col3\'><span lang=TH class=\'sarabun-font\'>(<v><%= @res_mon[:case_type].values.sum %></v> &#3619;&#3634;&#3618;)</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n \r\n <%\r\noptions = <<EXT\r\n1.1|Brain tumor surgery				\r\n1.2|Pediatric neurosurgery\r\n1.3|General neurosurgery \r\n1.4|Abnormal movement surgery\r\n1.5|Epilepsy surgery		\r\n1.6|Aneurysm Surgery\r\n1.7|Neurovascularization\r\n1.8|Carotid endarterectomy\r\n1.9|Neurovascular surgery other\r\n2.10|Spine surgery\r\n2.11|Peripheral nerve surgery\r\n2.12|Endovascular thrombectomy\r\n2.13|Embolization\r\n2.14|Neuroradiology diagnostic procedure\r\n2.15|General surgery\r\n2.16|Dental procedure  \r\n2.17|Eye surgery\r\n2.18|Pain intervention\r\n2.19|CPR\r\n2.20|Critical care\r\n0|Off operation\r\nEXT\r\n\r\n\r\n    options = options.split(\"\\n\").collect{|i| t=i.split(\"|\"); [t[1],t[0]] }\r\n\r\n    \r\n%>\r\n <% for x in options %>\r\n \r\n \r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=445 valign=top style=\'width:333.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\'>\r\n  <p class=col1><span lang=TH class=\'sarabun-font\'>     </span><span class=\'sarabun-font\'><%=x[1]%>\r\n  <%=x[0]%></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=60 valign=top style=\'width:45.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\'>\r\n  <p class=col1><span class=\'sarabun-font\'>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=133 valign=top style=\'width:99.9pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\'>\r\n  <p class=\'col3\'><span class=\'sarabun-font\'><v><%= @res_mon[:case_type][x[1]] %></v></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n \r\n <% end %>\r\n